<title>FRANCE: Pernod-Ricard nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Pernod-Ricard nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					12,057    vs   11,763</p>
<p>    -- of which third quarter		  4,076    vs    4,100</p>
<p>NOTE - Pernod-Ricard gave the figures in the official bulletin (BALO)</p>
